  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><ol list=\"u1e8444d7\"><li fid=\"u5c49aa19\" data-lake-id=\"ubea28dba\" id=\"ubea28dba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb818571\" id=\"ucb818571\" style=\"color: rgb(9, 64, 142)\">volatile</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8df4b1e6\" id=\"u8df4b1e6\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">是否可以修饰</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua8c7e553\" id=\"ua8c7e553\" style=\"color: rgb(9, 64, 142)\">const</span></li><li fid=\"u5c49aa19\" data-lake-id=\"ub68c27d6\" id=\"ub68c27d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"udbefa3b8\" id=\"udbefa3b8\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">如何快速一行代码操作</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0df8271a\" id=\"u0df8271a\" style=\"color: rgb(9, 64, 142)\">硬件寄存器</span></li><li fid=\"u5c49aa19\" data-lake-id=\"uf18352fb\" id=\"uf18352fb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc9a174e0\" id=\"uc9a174e0\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">如何最快比较两组寄存器里有多少位不同</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u5c49aa19\" data-lake-id=\"u26c8aece\" id=\"u26c8aece\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub11c7c30\" id=\"ub11c7c30\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">如何降低功耗</span></li><li fid=\"u5c49aa19\" data-lake-id=\"u477ac4a9\" id=\"u477ac4a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc568918f\" id=\"uc568918f\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">什么时候会用到do{}while(0)</span></li><li fid=\"u5c49aa19\" data-lake-id=\"u6523f870\" id=\"u6523f870\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58990147\" id=\"u58990147\" style=\"color: rgb(9, 64, 142)\">GPIO</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6ed66d34\" id=\"u6ed66d34\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">有几种状态</span></li><li fid=\"u5c49aa19\" data-lake-id=\"u60af5dde\" id=\"u60af5dde\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2efd4208\" id=\"u2efd4208\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">如何用软件处理硬件管脚抖动</span></strong></li><li fid=\"u5c49aa19\" data-lake-id=\"u39ec31b4\" id=\"u39ec31b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f902783\" id=\"u4f902783\" style=\"color: rgb(25, 27, 31)\">如何高效处理</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6e0767e5\